Package: cpy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Python-syntax interpreter written in portable C
 cpy runs Python-like programs through a from-scratch interpreter in C:
 classes, generators, async, networking, and common stdlib modules in one
 binary. Optional OpenSSL enables HTTPS. Suitable for scripts, Termux, and
 small tools where a full CPython install is heavy.
